{"schemaVersion":2,"sectionID":20022799,"chapterID":15000205,"chapterNumber":"II-5","sectionNumber":"25-222","title":"Requirements for developments or enlargements in the Outer Transit Zone","officialText":"","previewText":"R1 R2 R3 R4 R5 R6 R7 R8 R9 R10 R11 R12\n\nIn the districts indicated, within the Outer Transit Zone, for dwelling units created as part of a development or enlargement after December 5, 2024, the number of required accessory off-street parking spaces shall be determined by multiplying the number of dwelling units by the applicable parking requirement set forth for the applicable district in Columns A or B of the table ","blocks":[{"id":"zr-22799-block-001","kind":"html","html":"<p>R1 R2 R3 R4 R5 R6 R7 R8 R9 R10 R11 R12</p>","plainText":"R1 R2 R3 R4 R5 R6 R7 R8 R9 R10 R11 R12"},{"id":"zr-22799-block-002","kind":"html","html":"<p>In the districts indicated, within the <strong><em>Outer Transit Zone</em></strong>, for <strong><em>dwelling units</em></strong> created as part of a <strong><em>development</em></strong> or <strong><em>enlargement</em></strong> after December 5, 2024, the number of required <strong><em>accessory</em></strong> off-street parking spaces shall be determined by multiplying the number of <strong><em>dwelling units</em></strong> by the applicable parking requirement set forth for the applicable district in Columns A or B of the table below. However, where the calculation results in a number of parking spaces less than or equal to the number in Column C, no parking spaces shall be required for <strong><em>residences</em></strong> on the <strong><em>zoning lot</em></strong>.</p>","plainText":"In the districts indicated, within the Outer Transit Zone, for dwelling units created as part of a development or enlargement after December 5, 2024, the number of required accessory off-street parking spaces shall be determined by multiplying the number of dwelling units by the applicable parking requirement set forth for the applicable district in Columns A or B of the table below. However, where the calculation results in a number of parking spaces less than or equal to the number in Column C, no parking spaces shall be required for residences on the zoning lot."},{"id":"zr-22799-block-003","kind":"table","html":"<table class=\"Table\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse; border:none\" width=\"630\"><tbody><tr><td colspan=\"4\" style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; width:630px; padding:0in 8px 0in 8px; height:33px; background-color:#f7caac; border-top:1px solid black; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Courier\"><b><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\"><span style=\"color:black\">REQUIREMENTS FOR DWELLING UNITS</span></span></b></span></span></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr><tr><td rowspan=\"3\" style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; width:120px; padding:0in 8px 0in 8px; height:29px; background-color:#f7caac; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black\">\n\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\"><span style=\"color:black\">District</span></span></span></b></span></span></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; width:378px; padding:0in 8px 0in 8px; height:29px; background-color:#f7caac; border-top:none; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:none\">\n\t\t\t<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\"><span style=\"color:black\">Requirement</span></span></span></b></span></span></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; width:132px; padding:0in 8px 0in 8px; hei